== Walkthrough ==

After returning the Spell Book to Tergon, he tells you about another quest:  

: "Now I have news of a larger matter. It has to do with a [defector].  It seems a gnome magician by the name of Toko Binlittle has gone and left the guild. He joined forces with the Pirates of Gunthak. Find him. He must be destroyed."

'''The 'defector' is [[Toko Binlittle]], who is located on the Seafury Island near Gornit in the Ocean of Tears.'''

'''Kill him and bring back his head (he drops A [[Teir`Dal Head]] for some reason) and you will receive an [[Elemental Grimoire]], which is used for magician research.'''<br>
'''Excellent work, Menehune. It's unfortunate this had to be done, but we cannot allow our secrets to fall into the hands of others.'''<br>
You gain experience!!<br>
Your faction with EldritchCollective got better.<br>
Your faction standing with DarkReflection got worse.<br>
Your faction standing with TheDead got worse.<br>
Your faction standing with GemChoppers got better.<br>
Your faction standing with KingAk'Anon got better.<br>


